gn: justify;\">Consider the game in the left figure where Team A lost, and the counterfactual game in the right figure which shows what would have happened had Alex played <strong><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"background-color:#a8e68d;\">6<\/span><\/span><\/strong> in <strong>round #1<\/strong>&nbsp;and had Alex played <strong><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"background-color:#0fa65e;\">2<\/span><\/span><\/strong> in <strong>round #3<\/strong>. Once you understand what happened in the two games, <strong>please answer the question below<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Original game<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img height=\"438\" src=\"https:\/\/usc.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_bViFUlDQGICj3CU\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 438px;\" width=\"350\" \/>&nbsp;<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Counterfactual game<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img height=\"438\" src=\"https:\/\/usc.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_fnMFRG0RwD3Ggni\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 438px;\" width=\"350\" \/><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br \/>\nRemember, while we can see all the cards,&nbsp;<strong>the players do not see each others&#39; cards<\/strong>.<br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; width: 875px;\">To what extent do you think Alex and AP-5 are responsible for their team losing the game? Please indicate the degree of their responsibility by selecting the appropriate choice below:<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n","DataExportTag":"CF-A0-P-BB-HPxTR-122","QuestionID":"QID194","QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","QuestionDescription":"Evaluation Task \u00a0 Your task is to evaluate whether Alex and AP-5 have low, medium, or high respon...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Ale