sp;<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; width: 875px;\">To what extent do you think Alex and AP-5 are responsible for their team losing the game? Please indicate the&nbsp;degree of their responsibility by selecting the appropriate choice below:<\/div>\n\n<table>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q1979","QuestionID":"QID1979"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7PBUtX8e4Bhl1DU","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID198","SecondaryAttribute":"Evaluation Task \u00a0 Your task is to evaluate whether Alex and AP-5 have low, medium, or high respon..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"text-align: center; width: 875px;\"><u><strong>Evaluation Task<\/strong><\/u><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; width: 875px;\">Your task is to evaluate whether Alex and AP-5 have <em><strong>low<\/strong><\/em>, <em><strong>medium<\/strong><\/em>, or <em><strong>high<\/strong><\/em> responsibility for their team losing the game.<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:875px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Consider the game in the left figure where Team A lost, and the counterfactual game in the right figure which shows what would have happened had Alex played <strong><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"background-color:#a8e68d;\">4<\/span><\/span><\/strong> in <strong>round #1<\/strong>&nbsp;and had Alex played <strong><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"background-color:#0fa65e;\">3<\/span><\/span><\/strong> in <strong>round #3<\/strong>. Once you understand what happened in the two games, <strong>please answer the question below<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Original game<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img height=\"438\" src=\"https:\/\/usc.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_WToPlCahVVxDwtn\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 438px;\" width=\"350\" \/>&nbs