>, or <em><strong>high<\/strong><\/em> responsibility for their team losing the game.&nbsp;FFUL-bias1-BFxCH-438<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; width: 875px;\">Consider the following game where <strong>Team A lost<\/strong>. Once you understand what happened in the game, <strong>please answer the question below<\/strong>.&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center; width: 875px;\">&nbsp;<img width=\"350\" style=\"height: 438px; width: 350px;\" src=\"https:\/\/usc.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_k0weM9Gc72nYjOu\" height=\"438\"><\/div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center; width: 875px;\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center; width: 875px;\">Remember,&nbsp;<strong>the players see each others' cards<\/strong>.<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center; width: 875px;\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; width: 875px;\">To what extent do you think Alex and AP-5 are responsible for their team losing the game? Please indicate the&nbsp;degree of their responsibility by selecting the appropriate choice below:<\/div>\n\n<table>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q2059","QuestionID":"QID2059"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7PBUtX8e4Bhl1DU","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID206","SecondaryAttribute":"Evaluation Task \u00a0 Your task is to evaluate whether Alex and AP-5 have low, medium, or high respon..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"text-align: center; width: 875px;\"><u><strong>Evaluation Task<\/strong><\/u><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; width: 875px;\">Your task is to evaluate whether Alex and AP-5 have <em><strong>low<\/strong><\/em>, <em><strong>medium<\/strong><\/em>, or <em><strong>high<\/strong><\/em> responsibility for their team losing the game.<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:875px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">Consider the game in the left figure where Team A lost, and the counterfactual game in the right figure which shows what would have happened had Alex played <strong><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"background-color:#a8e68d;\">5<\/span><\/span><\/strong> in <strong>round #2<\/strong>&nbsp;and had AP-5 played <strong><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"background-color:#a8e68d;\">5<\/span><\/span><\/strong> in <strong>round #2<\/strong>. Once you understand what happened in the two games, <strong>please answer the question below<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Original game<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img height=\"438\" src=\"https:\/\/usc.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_AUtd6nvjeiy1CoJ\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 438px;\" width=\"350\" \/>&nbsp;<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Counterfactual game<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<img height=\"438\" src=\"https:\/\/usc.qualtrics.com\/CP\/Graphic.php?IM=IM_pUjeVPQYvKrGiEU\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 438px;\" width=\"350\" \/><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><br \/>\nRemember, while we can see all the cards,&nbsp;<strong>the players do not see each others&#39; cards<\/strong>.<br \/>\n&nbsp;<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; width: 875px;\">To what extent do you think Alex and AP-5 are responsible for their team losing the game? Please indicate the degree of their responsibility by selecting the appropriate choice below:<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n","DataExportTag":"CF-A0-P-BB-TRxTR-91","QuestionID":"QID206","QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","QuestionDescription":"Evaluation Task \u00a0 Your task is to evaluate whether Alex and AP-5 have low, medium, or