ify; width: 960px;\">To what extent do you think Alex and AP-5 are responsible for their team losing the game? Please indicate the degree of their responsibility by selecting the appropriate choice below:<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>","DataExportTag":"2CF-FUL-B0-TRxCH-596","QuestionID":"QID502","QuestionType":"Matrix","Selector":"Likert","SubSelector":"SingleAnswer","QuestionDescription":"Evaluation Task \u00a0\u00a0 Your task is to evaluate whether Alex and AP-5 have low, medium, or high respo...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Alex"},"2":{"Display":"AP-5"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2"],"Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"All"},"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"Answers":{"1":{"Display":"Low Responsibility"},"2":{"Display":"Medium Responsibility"},"3":{"Display":"High Responsibility"}},"AnswerOrder":["1","2","3"],"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","RepeatHeaders":"none","WhiteSpace":"OFF","MobileFirst":true},"NextChoiceId":3,"NextAnswerId":4,"ChoiceDataExportTags":false}},{"SurveyID":"SV_7PBUtX8e4Bhl1DU","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID503","SecondaryAttribute":"Evaluation Task \u00a0\u00a0 Your task is to evaluate whether Alex and AP-5 have low, medium, or high respo.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"text-align: center; width: 960px;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center; width: 960px;\"><u><strong>Evaluation Task<\/strong><\/u><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify; width: 960px;\">Your task is to evaluate whether Alex and AP-5 have <strong><em>low<\/em><\/strong>, <strong>medium<\/strong>, or <em><strong>high<\/strong><\/em> responsibility for their team losing the game.<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"10\" cellspac